@startuml
title EmberWatch | Current system architecture
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #E0F2FE
  BorderColor #0284C7
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #DCFCE7
  BorderColor #16A34A
}

actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "Operations user" as Ops
actor "Zone ranger" as Ranger

package "Simulation" {
  component "Cellular fire world\nSynthetic weather, fuel, moisture,\nwind-driven heat and smoke" as World #FEF3C7
  component "8 virtual gateways\nBatch readings, retry, chaos mode" as Gateways
  component "Simulation controls\nIgnite, extinguish, wind, rate" as Controls
}

package "Node.js service | Express + Socket.IO" {
  component "Ingestion\nZod validation, ownership checks,\ntoken buckets, sequence dedupe" as Ingest
  component "Live state + analysis\nEWMA / robust baseline,\nhysteresis, neighbour confirmation" as Analysis
  component "Incident lifecycle\nOpen, acknowledge, resolve" as Incidents
  component "Bounded batch writer\n500 ms flush, retry, backpressure" as Writer
  component "Rollup worker\nRebuild minute aggregates" as Rollups
  component "Express APIs\nAuth, history, controls, health" as API
  component "Socket.IO /live\nAuthorized zone and sensor rooms\n250 ms compact deltas + alerts" as Live
}

database "MongoDB\nDevices · users · gateways\nReadings · rollups · incidents" as DB
component "React control room\nLeaflet map + Canvas heat layer\nuPlot charts · history/replay\nVirtualized lists · metrics" as UI #FCE7F3

World --> Gateways : simulated telemetry
Gateways --> Ingest : authenticated batches
Ingest --> Analysis : accepted ordered events
Ingest --> Writer : queued readings
Analysis --> Incidents : anomaly transitions
Analysis --> Live : latest state deltas
Incidents --> DB : persisted incident updates
Incidents --> Live : reliable alert events
Writer --> DB : unordered batch inserts
DB --> Rollups : canonical persisted readings
Rollups --> DB : minute aggregates
DB <--> API : history, auth, state, controls
API <--> UI : HTTPS
Live <--> UI : Socket.IO
Admin --> API : authenticated simulation controls
API --> Controls : validated command
Controls --> World : change scenario
Ops --> UI
Ranger --> UI : assigned zones only

note right of UI
  Current map tiles are real OpenStreetMap geography.
  Sensor positions, zones, weather and fire behavior
  are generated for the fictional Kaiser Ridge scenario.
end note
@enduml
